{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"centripetal-force-calculator UI copy.additionalFaqs.1.answer","detected_language":"sw","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"centripetal-force-calculator.copy.additionalFaqs.1.answer","keys":["centripetal-force-calculator.copy.additionalFaqs.1.answer"],"locale":"sw","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"Centripetal nguvu inaelezea ndani ya nguvu safi inahitajika kwa ajili ya mzunguko wa harakati katika inertial mfumo. “Centrifugal nguvu” ni wazi nje ya nguvu kutumika katika mwongozo wa kuzunguka mfumo.","record_id":"a82d807dbfc04492ec0a537022326e35f62c36a6f863d48c4e09980b55368193","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40565692987","seconds":0.999921521000033,"source":"Centripetal force describes the inward net force needed for circular motion in an inertial frame. “Centrifugal force” is an apparent outward force used in a rotating reference frame.","source_commit":"e8a7cb94dc75d40f2c0e14bb27c0a1819e230012","source_hash":"c6925c518fa8691d01224b6b38d8308545b8b1278ec14914c7c2e59a19d62a39","status":"machine-draft","translation":"Centripetal nguvu inaelezea ndani ya nguvu safi inahitajika kwa ajili ya mzunguko wa harakati katika inertial mfumo. “Centrifugal nguvu” ni wazi nje ya nguvu kutumika katika mwongozo wa kuzunguka mfumo.","truncated":false,"warnings":[]}
